abstract: "Alpha-local, non-clinical educational/research simulator for cerebrum-shaped interval memory events, deterministic crossmodal pair construction, feature-vector encoding for QNN candidate lanes, and deterministic PyTorch surrogate fallback. Not clinical, diagnostic, therapeutic, or production-public. License is a custom responsible-research notice pending maintainer/legal review."
